## Products

Product pages are also available as Markdown by appending `.md` to the page URL (`https://exa.ai/products/search.md`), or by requesting the page URL with `Accept: text/markdown`.

### Search API

Search the web and extract contents from the results. Built for AI applications and agents. Use Deep Search for multi-step web search with reasoning and structured outputs for complex research tasks.

- [Search API](https://exa.ai/products/search)
- [Search documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/search/quickstart.md)
- [Deep Search](https://exa.ai/products/deep)
- [Search best practices](https://exa.ai/docs/search/best-practices.md)

### Contents API

Extract clean, LLM-ready web content from any URL, including JavaScript-rendered pages, PDFs, and complex layouts.

- [Contents API](https://exa.ai/products/contents)
- [Contents API documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/contents/quickstart.md)

### Exa Snapshot

Search and read the web as it was on a past date. Set a cutoff and Exa returns only page versions stored on or before it, for RL environments, evals and backtests.

- [Exa Snapshot](https://exa.ai/products/snapshot)
- [Snapshot documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/search/snapshot.md)

### Agent

Run multi-step web research, list-building, and enrichment workflows with natural-language answers, structured outputs, and citations.

- [Agent](https://exa.ai/products/agent)
- [Agent documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/agent/quickstart.md)

### Websets

Build lists of companies and people from plain-English criteria. Each result is checked against the criteria, with reasoning and sources, and enriched with columns you describe.

- [Websets](https://exa.ai/products/websets)
- [Websets documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/websets/quickstart.md)

### Monitors API

Run a search on a schedule and receive only new results, with a cited answer, delivered to your webhook. Track company news, RFPs, competitors, and other changes on the web.

- [Monitors API](https://exa.ai/products/monitors)
- [Monitors documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/monitors/quickstart.md)

### Exa Connect

Connect your agents to the world's public and private data, including web analytics, private markets, company and contact data, financial data, healthcare intelligence, compliance data, and other specialized datasets from leading providers.

- [Exa Connect](https://exa.ai/connect)
- [Connect documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/agent/connect/overview.md)

### Exa Library

Exa Library collections are searchable through the standard search call. They cover people, companies, job postings, places, sports, weather, earnings calls, SEC filings, stock pages, market quotes, products, events, podcasts, legal entities, court opinions, legislation, patents, research papers, Wikipedia, countries, indicators, clinical trials, drugs, drug authorizations, diseases, molecules and genes.

- [Exa Library](https://exa.ai/library)
