## Pricing

Exa can be started for free. New accounts receive $10 in free credits every month, plus a one-time $10 bonus for completing onboarding, with no payment method required. The Starter plan (free) includes access to all endpoints.

Paid API usage is pay-as-you-go. An annual Growth plan adds zero data retention and 50 QPS, and Enterprise plans are available for custom limits, infrastructure, security requirements, and support.

- [Pricing](https://exa.ai/pricing)
- [Exa for Startups](https://exa.ai/startups)
- [Pricing documentation](https://exa.ai/docs/admin/pricing.md)
- [Billing](https://exa.ai/docs/admin/billing.md)
- [Rate limits](https://exa.ai/docs/admin/billing.md)

